# Local development flags only. The Anthropic API key is NEVER read from here —
# enter it in the app's Settings window; it's stored via the macOS Keychain
# (docs/SECURITY.md → Secrets). Connector secrets never go here either.
#
# Nothing in M1 reads this file. Test-only overrides (LEGIO_USER_DATA_DIR,
# LEGIO_ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL, LEGIO_MOCK_KEYCHAIN) are set by the E2E suite and
# are ignored by packaged builds.
